{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_9","type":"command_execution","command":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\chuanle song\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Microsoft\\\\WindowsApps\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command \"Get-Content -Raw 'pipeline/designs/exp_design_20260926-155700.md'; Get-Content -Raw 'pipeline/reviews/motivation_review_20260926-155700.md'\"","aggregated_output":"# Experiment Design - AdaRES_project\n\n2026-09-26 15:57 Asia/Shanghai\n\n## 1. Motivation\nGoal: \"AdaRES: improve a faithful standard-indicator 3D referring expression segmentation baseline by learning query confidence from metric-aligned evidence, targeting ScanRefer mIoU >= 0.515.\" Prepared active 1/2, candidate budget one. L1 and L2 tested distinct unverified mask-conditioned confidence mechanisms.\n\n## 2. Current Best Results\n| ID | State | mIoU | Acc@0.25 | Acc@0.5 | spmIoU |\n|---|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|\n| B1 | complete | 0.5020 | 0.610 | 0.553 | 0.467 |\n| B4-E30 | champion | 0.5094 | 0.608 | 0.562 | 0.474 |\n| H5 | early stop | 0.5061 | unavailable | unavailable | unavailable |\n| G1 | provisional running | 0.4983 interim at previous snapshot | unavailable | unavailable | unavailable |\n\n## 3. Analysis & Direction\nOn the fixed 441-expression B4 subset, 240 material errors remain. L1 oracle coherence higher in 116/240; standalone coherence mIoU 0.13079. L2 oracle local boundary contrast higher in 104/240; standalone boundary mIoU 0.25651. B4 indicator on the same subset is 0.49186. Neither mechanism offers directional support. Prior H/J/K and earlier routes are not recycled. G1 awaits terminal reconciliation.\n\n## 4. Experiment Plan\nNo training experiment admitted. L1 and L2 fail diagnosis. Controls ran natively, but candidate-specific backward, resources, independent model package, goal-compliance review and receipt are not asserted. Candidate budget one is a maximum, not a quota.\n\n## 5. GPU Allocation Plan\nServer-2 GPU0 and GPU1 showed 1 MiB and 0% in the one targeted live check, with no G1 training process. Queue still marks G1 running on GPU0 under deathwatch 1/3; do not mutate that state outside normal monitor. GPU1 stays vacant. Server-6 excluded.\n\n## 6. Implementation Checklist\n- [x] Native paired read-only fixed 16-scene L1 and L2 diagnoses and standalone controls.\n- [x] Preserve raw paired evidence and reject proposed mechanisms.\n- [ ] No model/config, native backward/resource gate, receipt, sync or safe dispatch until a new candidate passes all six gates.\n- [ ] Reconcile G1 in the scheduled monitor and compare terminal result to B4-E30.\n\n## 7. Risk Assessment\nValidation-subset observational evidence cannot establish global failure of mask-conditioned confidence. The L1 and L2 measures use already learned decoder features. Local-neighbor graph inference adds computation but was diagnostic only; no full-training profile exists. G1 may alter the relevant bottleneck.\n\n## 8. Smell Check\nChanging the score weight, feature definition, neighborhood count or a threshold after these negative screens would be validation tuning, not a new causal mechanism. None is admitted.\n\nStatus: NO ADMISSION. Stop after two distinct executable native diagnoses were disconfirmed in this cycle; this does not establish global route exhaustion. Resume on G1 terminal reconciliation or new independent evidence with a concrete native next action.\n\r\n# Motivation Review - AdaRES_project\n\n2026-09-26 15:57 Asia/Shanghai\n\n## 1. Goal\nGoal: \"AdaRES: improve a faithful standard-indicator 3D referring expression segmentation baseline by learning query confidence from metric-aligned evidence, targeting ScanRefer mIoU >= 0.515.\" B1 0.5020, B4-E30 champion 0.5094, gap 0.0056. All seven goal constraints and three bans apply.\n\n## 2. Story Status\n| Hypothesis | Status | Evidence | Gap |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Competition-aware confidence | Partial improvement | B4-E30 0.5094 | Not at target; continuation is not a fresh matched control |\n| Metric-aligned target labels | Provisional running record | G1 was 0.4983 interim best at prior snapshot; no process in targeted live check | Normal monitor deathwatch and terminal result pending |\n| Mask-conditioned visual coherence | Disconfirmed as stated | L1 oracle higher in 116/240 material errors | No admission |\n| Mask-local boundary contrast | Disconfirmed as stated | L2 oracle higher in 104/240 material errors | No admission |\n\n## 3. Experiment Assessment\nB1 0.5020 and B4-E30 0.5094 establish the baseline and champion. D1 0.5080, F4 0.5060 and H5 0.5061 did not improve the champion; B2-E30 0.5058 and C1/C2-E30 0.5008/0.5014 likewise did not. G1 is not judged by interim metrics or an absent process alone. Earlier J1/J2 and K1/K2 fixed screens failed diagnosis. L1/L2 also fail the proposed directional mechanism.\n\n## 4. Gap Analysis\nThe fixed B4 subset has oracle mIoU 0.87316 versus selected 0.49186, but this only bounds ranking headroom. Full-validation G1 outcome, active queries, latency and peak memory are pending. No measured confidence mechanism currently passes all six admission gates.\n\n## 5. Design Rationale\nL1 tested whether predicted-mask interior visual coherence could supply quality evidence beyond B4's competitor context. L2 tested a different local neighborhood relation at mask boundaries. Both were evaluated against same-scene selected/oracle pairs and standalone selectors before considering a training variant. Negative directions do not justify scanning weights, neighbors, temperatures or feature definitions on validation.\n\n## 6. Next Batch\nNo new admission, despite candidate budget one. See `pipeline/designs/exp_design_20260926-155700.md`. Resume after G1 terminal reconciliation or on new independent, prospective diagnosis with controls and six gates.\n\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_10","type":"command_execution","command":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\chuanle song\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Microsoft\\\\WindowsApps\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command \"Get-ChildItem AdaRES/tools -Name | Select-String 'diagnose_adares|probe_adares'; Get-Content -Raw 'pipeline/reports/summary_20260926-160100.md'\"","aggregated_output":"\r\ndiagnose_adares_b0_oracle.py\r\ndiagnose_adares_b4_selection.py\r\ndiagnose_adares_d1_pair_mechanism.py\r\ndiagnose_adares_d1_selection.py\r\ndiagnose_adares_e1_stability.py\r\ndiagnose_adares_f1_mask_uncertainty.py\r\ndiagnose_adares_f2_geometry.py\r\ndiagnose_adares_f3_seed_alignment.py\r\ndiagnose_adares_f4_reanchor.py\r\ndiagnose_adares_g1_label_alignment.py\r\ndiagnose_adares_h1_sampling_coverage.py\r\ndiagnose_adares_h2_fine_coverage.py\r\ndiagnose_adares_h3_score_evidence.py\r\ndiagnose_adares_h4_relation_cohort.py\r\ndiagnose_adares_h5_query_access.py\r\ndiagnose_adares_j1_mask_language_evidence.py\r\ndiagnose_adares_k1_sampler_rank.py\r\ndiagnose_adares_l1_feature_consistency.py\r\nprobe_adares_d1_real_batch.py\r\nprobe_adares_f4_real_batch.py\r\nprobe_adares_h5_real_batch.py\r\n# Research Pipeline Report - AdaRES_project\n\n2026-09-26 16:01 Asia/Shanghai (design)\n\n## 0. Goal Status\n| Target | Champion | Gap | Phase |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| ScanRefer mIoU >= 0.5150 | B4-E30 0.5094 | 0.0056 | 1, not reached; Phase 2 pending |\n\nB1 baseline 0.5020, champion gain +0.0074. Prepared goal preflight succeeded once before Codex and was not rerun.\n\n## 1. GPU Overview\n| Server | GPU | Util | Memory Used | Process / Assignment |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|---|\n| server-2 | 0 | 0% | 1 MiB | no training process seen; G1 queue record under deathwatch 1/3 |\n| server-2 | 1 | 0% | 1 MiB | vacant after read-only diagnosis |\n\nServer-6 excluded. GPU values from one targeted live query, not a repeat monitor pass.\n\n## 2. Running Experiments\n| ID | Config | Server | GPU | Epoch | Best mIoU | Acc@50 | spmIOU | No-Impr | Status |\n|---|---|---|---:|---|---:|---|---|---|---|\n| AdaRES-G1 | `configs_song/model_paper5/adares_g1_metric_targets_res.yaml` | server-2 | 0 | 29/30 at prior 14:47 snapshot | 0.4983 interim | unavailable | unavailable | 5/10 prior | queue running; process absent in targeted check |\n\nThe normal monitor will resolve deathwatch; no manual terminal or metric inference was made.\n\n## 3. Queue Status\n| Position | ID | Config | Status | Depends On | Server |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| - | - | - | no waiting or claiming tasks | - | - |\n\nPrepared active 1/2 (one provisional running); candidate budget one. L1/L2 fail diagnosis, so no task admitted to fill GPU1.\n\n## 4. This Tick's Actions\n- Read prepared context, goal and durable memory; followed design mode. Did not repeat monitor or goal checks.\n- Ran two fixed 16-scene native read-only B4-E30 probes on server-2 GPU1 (441 expressions, 240 material errors): L1 interior coherence standalone mIoU 0.13079 and L2 local boundary standalone mIoU 0.25651 versus B4 subset 0.49186. Oracle direction supported in only 116/240 and 104/240 errors, respectively.\n- Rejected L1/L2; preserved raw rows, paired analysis, motivation review, design and SHA256 evidence in `research_work.json`. Verified diagnostic Python syntax. No candidate model/config, receipt, training sync or safe dispatch.\n- Targeted GPU check showed no G1 process; left queue status for scheduled monitor reconciliation. Pruned summaries older than 24 hours.\n\n## 5. Decisions Made\n- 2026-09-26 16:00 `route_change`: L1/L2 fail diagnosis; keep server-2 GPU1 vacant. See `pipeline/decisions/20260926-160022_route_change.md`.\n- Resume after G1 terminal reconciliation or independent prospectively testable evidence with matched controls and all six gates. No pending questions in prepared manifest.\n\nNext scheduled tick: approximately 2026-09-26 16:47 Asia/Shanghai.\n\r\n\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
